d":"2026-04-23T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"57 min"},{"id":"tt30459041:2:5","season":2,"episode":5,"title":"Casi invisible","overview":"Barney lucha con la auditoría de Ashe en el gimnasio de Nick. Coop y Jack visitan a un inversionista. Nick hace una fiesta en su casa nueva.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/djqGUjMqU7AxqYAbfxnCo2Be7wO.jpg","released":"2026-04-30T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"59 min"},{"id":"tt30459041:2:6","season":2,"episode":6,"title":"Para todo lo demás, tenía los bolos","overview":"Coop y su familia atienden a un funeral y un velorio.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/htfy0mGyz1dzvX9j7dowdXVtept.jpg","released":"2026-05-07T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"42 min"},{"id":"tt30459041:2:7","season":2,"episode":7,"title":"Al este","overview":"Coop y Sam van a un fin de semana salvaje con Ashe en Los Hamptons. Mel toma medidas extremas contra sus vecinos.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oMOWpYQbjiNgGf5gPFZHyVFVmCV.jpg","released":"2026-05-14T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"57 min"},{"id":"tt30459041:2:8","season":2,"episode":8,"title":"Me siento perdida","overview":"Mel y Tori enfrentan las consecuencias de sus acciones. Sam intenta terminar con Ashe. Coop queda atrapado entre la espada y la pared.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r18w0RYSIqdEzaOyCaYFpIW8gNE.jpg","released":"2026-05-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"57 min"},{"id":"tt30459041:2:9","season":2,"episode":9,"title":"Propaganda de los cobardes","overview":"Las alianzas tiemblan cuando Coop, Barney y Nick van a cenar a la mansión de Ashe.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4aoLyPug8KtZWLo5oTitpGox7GQ.jpg","released":"2026-05-28T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"54 min"},{"id":"tt30459041:2:10","season":2,"episode":10,"title":"La noche del cazador","overview":"Con otro escándalo sorpresivo cerca, los vecinos se reúnen para el día del padre en el club.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o3c6GyTORTJeWtW8nxNqqzxdELU.jpg","released":"2026-06-04T12:00:00